---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Marketing kalkulyatori: CAC, ROMI, LTV"
description: "Bitta mijoz sizga qanchaga tushyapti, reklama o'zini oqlayaptimi va mijoz butun davr davomida qancha foyda keltiradi — CAC, ROMI va LTV ni bir daqiqada bepul hisoblang."
permalink: "/kalkulyator/"
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Marketing kalkulyatori</span>
    <h1>Reklamangiz o'zini oqlayaptimi?</h1>
    <p class="lead">Uchta raqam biznesdagi marketing ahvolini aytib beradi: bitta mijoz sizga qanchaga tushyapti, reklamaga tikilgan har so'm qancha foyda qaytaryapti va bitta mijoz siz bilan bo'lgan butun davrda qancha olib keladi.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--deep calc-band">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="switch reveal" role="tablist" aria-label="Ko'rsatkich">
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-cac" aria-controls="panel-cac" aria-selected="true">CAC</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-romi" aria-controls="panel-romi" aria-selected="false">ROMI</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-ltv" aria-controls="panel-ltv" aria-selected="false">LTV</button>
    </div>

    <p class="calc-sample reveal">Maydonlarda namuna raqamlar turibdi — o'zingiznikini yozing, natija darhol yangilanadi.</p>

    <!-- CAC — bitta mijozni jalb qilish narxi -->
    <div class="plan-panel" id="panel-cac" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-cac">
      <div class="calc reveal">
        <form class="calc__in form" novalidate>
          <div class="calc__intro">
            <h2 class="calc__title">CAC — bitta mijoz narxi</h2>
            <p>Bitta yangi mijozni olib kelish uchun marketing va sotuvga qancha pul ketganini ko'rsatadi. Bir oy yoki bitta kampaniya kabi aniq davrni oling.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="cac-ads">Reklama xarajati</label>
            <div class="calc__input"><input id="cac-ads" data-num inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="3 000 000"><span class="unit">so'm</span></div>
            <p class="hint">Target, bloger, Google — shu davrdagi barcha reklama to'lovlari.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="cac-other">Boshqa marketing xarajatlari</label>
            <div class="calc__input"><input id="cac-other" data-num inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="2 000 000"><span class="unit">so'm</span></div>
            <p class="hint">SMM mutaxassis, dizayn, video, agentlik, sotuvchi bonusi. Bo'lmasa bo'sh qoldiring.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cac-leads">Murojaatlar (lidlar)</label>
              <div class="calc__input"><input id="cac-leads" data-num inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="120"><span class="unit">ta</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="cac-clients">Yangi mijozlar</label>
              <div class="calc__input"><input id="cac-clients" data-num inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="25"><span class="unit">ta</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="cac-check">O'rtacha chek <span class="opt">ixtiyoriy</span></label>
            <div class="calc__input"><input id="cac-check" data-num data-key="check" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="450 000"><span class="unit">so'm</span></div>
            <p class="hint">Bitta xarid o'rtacha qancha. CAC ni shu bilan solishtiramiz.</p>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="calc__clear" data-clear>Maydonlarni tozalash</button>
        </form>

        <div class="calc__out" aria-live="polite">
          <span class="calc__label">Bitta mijoz narxi</span>
          <output class="calc__big" id="cac-out">—</output>
          <dl class="calc__rows">
            <div><dt>Bitta murojaat narxi (CPL)</dt><dd id="cac-cpl">—</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Murojaatdan mijozga o'tish</dt><dd id="cac-conv">—</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Jami sarflangan</dt><dd id="cac-total">—</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="calc__verdict" id="cac-verdict" hidden></p>
          <button type="button" class="calc__more" data-goto="tab-ltv">Bu mijoz o'zini qoplaydimi? LTV ni hisoblang →</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ROMI — marketingga tikilgan pulning qaytimi -->
    <div class="plan-panel" id="panel-romi" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-romi" hidden>
      <div class="calc reveal">
        <form class="calc__in form" novalidate>
          <div class="calc__intro">
            <h2 class="calc__title">ROMI — reklama qaytimi</h2>
            <p>Reklamaga tikilgan har so'm qancha sof foyda bo'lib qaytganini ko'rsatadi. Tushum emas, aynan foyda — shuning uchun marja kerak.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="romi-spend">Marketing xarajati</label>
            <div class="calc__input"><input id="romi-spend" data-num inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="5 000 000"><span class="unit">so'm</span></div>
            <p class="hint">Reklama va unga bog'liq barcha xarajatlar.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="romi-rev">Reklamadan kelgan savdo</label>
            <div class="calc__input"><input id="romi-rev" data-num inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="18 000 000"><span class="unit">so'm</span></div>
            <p class="hint">Shu reklama orqali kelgan mijozlar to'lagan umumiy summa.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="romi-margin">Marja</label>
            <div class="calc__input"><input id="romi-margin" data-dec data-key="margin" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="40"><span class="unit">%</span></div>
            <p class="hint">Tannarx chiqib ketgandan keyin qoladigan ulush. 100 000 so'mlik mahsulot tannarxi 60 000 bo'lsa — marja 40%.</p>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="calc__clear" data-clear>Maydonlarni tozalash</button>
        </form>

        <div class="calc__out" aria-live="polite">
          <span class="calc__label">Reklama qaytimi (ROMI)</span>
          <output class="calc__big" id="romi-out">—</output>
          <dl class="calc__rows">
            <div><dt>Marketingdan sof foyda</dt><dd id="romi-profit">—</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Har 1 so'm reklamaga savdo (ROAS)</dt><dd id="romi-roas">—</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Zararsizlik uchun kerakli ROAS</dt><dd id="romi-be">—</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Tushumdan hisoblangan ROI <span class="opt">bo'rttirilgan</span></dt><dd id="romi-naive">—</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="calc__verdict" id="romi-verdict" hidden></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- LTV — mijozning butun davrdagi qiymati -->
    <div class="plan-panel" id="panel-ltv" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-ltv" hidden>
      <div class="calc reveal">
        <form class="calc__in form" novalidate>
          <div class="calc__intro">
            <h2 class="calc__title">LTV — mijoz qiymati</h2>
            <p>Bitta mijoz siz bilan bo'lgan butun davrda qancha foyda keltirishini ko'rsatadi. CAC bilan solishtirsangiz, reklamaga qancha sarflash mumkinligi ma'lum bo'ladi.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="ltv-check">O'rtacha chek</label>
            <div class="calc__input"><input id="ltv-check" data-num data-key="check" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="450 000"><span class="unit">so'm</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="ltv-freq">Bir mijoz necha marta xarid qiladi</label>
            <div class="calc__pair">
              <div class="calc__input"><input id="ltv-freq" data-dec inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="1"><span class="unit">marta</span></div>
              <select id="ltv-freq-per" aria-label="Qaysi davrda">
                <option value="1" selected>oyiga</option>
                <option value="12">yiliga</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="ltv-life">Mijoz siz bilan qancha qoladi</label>
            <div class="calc__pair">
              <div class="calc__input"><input id="ltv-life" data-dec inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="8"></div>
              <select id="ltv-life-unit" aria-label="Muddat birligi">
                <option value="1" selected>oy</option>
                <option value="12">yil</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <p class="hint">Birinchi xariddan oxirgisigacha o'rtacha qancha vaqt o'tadi.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="ltv-margin">Marja</label>
              <div class="calc__input"><input id="ltv-margin" data-dec data-key="margin" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" value="40"><span class="unit">%</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="ltv-cac">Bitta mijoz narxi (CAC)</label>
              <div class="calc__input"><input id="ltv-cac" data-num inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" value="200 000"><span class="unit">so'm</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="hint">CAC birinchi tabdagi natijadan avtomatik olinadi. O'zingiz yozsangiz, sizning raqamingiz qoladi.</p>
          <button type="button" class="calc__clear" data-clear>Maydonlarni tozalash</button>
        </form>

        <div class="calc__out" aria-live="polite">
          <span class="calc__label">Mijozdan butun davrdagi foyda</span>
          <output class="calc__big" id="ltv-out">—</output>
          <dl class="calc__rows">
            <div><dt>LTV : CAC nisbati</dt><dd id="ltv-ratio">—</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Mijoz narxi qoplanadi</dt><dd id="ltv-payback">—</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Mijozdan jami savdo</dt><dd id="ltv-rev">—</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Jami xaridlar soni</dt><dd id="ltv-count">—</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="calc__verdict" id="ltv-verdict" hidden></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="calc-cta reveal">Raqamlar yoqmadimi? <a href="/kontakt/#konsultatsiya">Bepul auditda</a> qaysi kanal pulni yeyayotganini birga topamiz.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="lockup reveal">
      <h2>Bu raqamlar nimani anglatadi</h2>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p class="sub">Formulalar oddiy tilda</p>
    </div>

    <div class="plans reveal stagger">
      <div class="plan">
        <div class="plan__head">
          <h3>CAC</h3>
          <p>Customer Acquisition Cost — bitta yangi mijozni jalb qilish narxi.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Formula</h4>
          <ul><li>Marketing va sotuv xarajatlari ÷ yangi mijozlar soni</li></ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Qachon xavotir olish kerak</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>CAC oydan oyga o'syapti, savdo esa joyida turibdi</li>
            <li>CAC birinchi xariddagi foydadan katta va mijozlar qaytib kelmayapti</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="plan">
        <div class="plan__head">
          <h3>ROMI</h3>
          <p>Return on Marketing Investment — marketingga tikilgan pulning qaytimi.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Formula</h4>
          <ul><li>(Savdo × marja − marketing xarajati) ÷ marketing xarajati × 100%</li></ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Qachon xavotir olish kerak</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>ROMI noldan past — reklama foyda emas, zarar keltiryapti</li>
            <li>ROI ni tushumdan hisoblayapsiz — bu natijani bir necha baravar bo'rttiradi</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="plan">
        <div class="plan__head">
          <h3>LTV</h3>
          <p>Lifetime Value — mijozning siz bilan bo'lgan butun davrdagi qiymati.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Formula</h4>
          <ul><li>O'rtacha chek × jami xaridlar soni × marja</li></ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Qachon xavotir olish kerak</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>LTV : CAC nisbati 1 dan past — har yangi mijoz zarar</li>
            <li>Nisbat 3 dan past — o'sish uchun zaxira kam. Ko'p bizneslar 3 : 1 ni mo'ljal qiladi</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="plans-note reveal">Kalkulyator yo'nalish beradi, chuqur tahlil o'rnini bosmaydi: natija siz kiritgan raqamlar qanchalik aniq bo'lsa, shunchalik to'g'ri chiqadi.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="/js/kalkulyator.js" defer></script>
